    {
      "id": "legend-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6480,
      "y": 125,
      "width": 2700,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a03m",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 710055433,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 910733103,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "━━▶  Synchronous / HTTP                         (blue)\n┈┈▶  Async command or event via RabbitMQ       (violet, dotted)\n┅┅▶  File read / copy / write                  (teal, dashed)\n━━▶  Native OS process execution               (amber)\n━━▶  External publishing API                   (orange)\n┈┈▶  Logs / operational signal                 (gray)\n\nBoundaries show architectural contexts; paths shown are conceptual where noted.",
      "originalText": "━━▶  Synchronous / HTTP                         (blue)\n┈┈▶  Async command or event via RabbitMQ       (violet, dotted)\n┅┅▶  File read / copy / write                  (teal, dashed)\n━━▶  Native OS process execution               (amber)\n━━▶  External publishing API                   (orange)\n┈┈▶  Logs / operational signal                 (gray)\n\nBoundaries show architectural contexts; paths shown are conceptual where noted.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
