      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 917121572,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "WHY SEGMENT FIRST?\nReduce media processing scope before fine-grained FFmpeg processing.\nOnly the required chunks are copied, joined and cropped — the complete live stream is not processed again.",
