      "seed": 710950280,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 922567480,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "RABBITMQ — EVENT BROKER / ASYNCHRONOUS BACKBONE\n\nConceptual commands/events: Intent • Preparing • Join • Crop • Publish • Failure / Reprocessing • Cleanup\nDecouples long-running processing stages. Queue names are intentionally conceptual.",
      "originalText": "RABBITMQ — EVENT BROKER / ASYNCHRONOUS BACKBONE\n\nConceptual commands/events: Intent • Preparing • Join • Crop • Publish • Failure / Reprocessing • Cleanup\nDecouples long-running processing stages. Queue names are intentionally conceptual.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rabbitmq-backbone",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "boundElements": []
    },
    {
      "id": "text-file-server",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 338,
      "y": 3582.5,
      "width": 1564,
      "height": 495,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a050",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 710966118,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 922776938,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "FILE SERVER / MEDIA STORAGE\nshared on-premises filesystem\n\n/raw/\n• raw TS media\n\n/segments/\n• 10-second TS chunks\n• M3U8 manifest\n• ~2h restream window\n\n/join/{cropUUID}/\n• copied chunks\n• joined-raw.ts\n\n/crop/{cropUUID}/\n• crop working files\n\n/final/\n• final media\n\nConceptual paths — media lifecycle is correlated by Crop UUID",
      "originalText": "FILE SERVER / MEDIA STORAGE\nshared on-premises filesystem\n\n/raw/\n• raw TS media\n\n/segments/\n• 10-second TS chunks\n• M3U8 manifest\n• ~2h restream window\n\n/join/{cropUUID}/\n• copied chunks\n• joined-raw.ts\n\n/crop/{cropUUID}/\n• crop working files\n\n/final/\n• final media\n\nConceptual paths — media lifecycle is correlated by Crop UUID",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "file-server",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "boundElements": []
    },
