    {
      "id": "text-preparing-algorithm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2086,
      "y": 3627.5,
      "width": 1168,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a053",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 711013632,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 923405312,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "PREPARING — CHUNK SELECTION\n\nTimeline\n0s ── 10s ── 20s ── 30s ── 40s\n       13s ─────────────── 37s\n\nZero-based chunks\n0 = 0–10       1 = 10–20\n2 = 20–30     3 = 30–40\n\nchunkIndex = floor(timestamp / 10s)\noffset = timestamp % 10s\n\nStart 13s → index 1; startOffset 3s\nEnd 37s → index 3; endOffset 7s\n\nRequired chunks: 1, 2, 3\nFine crop removes first 3s and ends at 7s in the final chunk.",
      "originalText": "PREPARING — CHUNK SELECTION\n\nTimeline\n0s ── 10s ── 20s ── 30s ── 40s\n       13s ─────────────── 37s\n\nZero-based chunks\n0 = 0–10       1 = 10–20\n2 = 20–30     3 = 30–40\n\nchunkIndex = floor(timestamp / 10s)\noffset = timestamp % 10s\n\nStart 13s → index 1; startOffset 3s\nEnd 37s → index 3; endOffset 7s\n\nRequired chunks: 1, 2, 3\nFine crop removes first 3s and ends at 7s in the final chunk.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "preparing-algorithm",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "boundElements": []
    },
    {
      "id": "text-sql-server",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3434,
      "y": 3660,
      "width": 782,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a054",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 711029470,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 923614770,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "ONE SHARED SQL SERVER INSTANCE\nPersistent business / execution state\n\nLogical ownership through isolated schemas:\n• Intent / BFF schema\n• Preparing schema\n• Join schema\n• Crop schema\n• Publish schema\n• other service schemas when needed\n\nDestination-level publish execution state\n\nServices own their schemas.\nIntegration occurs through APIs/events\nrather than direct cross-schema coupling.",
      "originalText": "ONE SHARED SQL SERVER INSTANCE\nPersistent business / execution state\n\nLogical ownership through isolated schemas:\n• Intent / BFF schema\n• Preparing schema\n• Join schema\n• Crop schema\n• Publish schema\n• other service schemas when needed\n\nDestination-level publish execution state\n\nServices own their schemas.\nIntegration occurs through APIs/events\nrather than direct cross-schema coupling.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sql-server",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "boundElements": []
    },
    {
