    {
      "id": "text-partial-failure",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8026,
      "y": 3380,
      "width": 1088,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a05g",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 711267040,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 926756640,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "PARTIAL FAILURE / IDEMPOTENT REPROCESSING\n\nExample result\nFacebook ✓   Instagram ✓   Twitter ✓   YouTube ✗\n\nPersist destination-level execution state\n↓ Failure Event carries same Crop UUID\n↓ Reprocessing coordinates recovery\n↓ Publish receives same Crop UUID\n↓ Load previous execution state\n↓ Skip successful destinations\n↓ Retry YouTube only\n↓ Update destination state → DONE\n\nKnown mechanism: Crop UUID + persisted state.\nNo additional idempotency mechanism is assumed.",
      "originalText": "PARTIAL FAILURE / IDEMPOTENT REPROCESSING\n\nExample result\nFacebook ✓   Instagram ✓   Twitter ✓   YouTube ✗\n\nPersist destination-level execution state\n↓ Failure Event carries same Crop UUID\n↓ Reprocessing coordinates recovery\n↓ Publish receives same Crop UUID\n↓ Load previous execution state\n↓ Skip successful destinations\n↓ Retry YouTube only\n↓ Update destination state → DONE\n\nKnown mechanism: Crop UUID + persisted state.\nNo additional idempotency mechanism is assumed.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "partial-failure",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "boundElements": []
    },
