      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a061",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 711662990,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 931993090,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "Given a Crop UUID, operators could correlate a distributed lifecycle across services, RabbitMQ messages, state, filesystem directories and indexed logs.",
      "originalText": "Given a Crop UUID, operators could correlate a distributed lifecycle across services, RabbitMQ messages, state, filesystem directories and indexed logs.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "boundElements": []
    },
    {
      "id": "text-scale-constraints",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5692,
      "y": 5145.625,
      "width": 786,
      "height": 318.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a062",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 711678828,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 932202548,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "SCALE & CONSTRAINTS\n\n• CPU → FFmpeg processing\n• RAM → concurrent processes / services\n• DISK → raw media + segments + temp files\n• DISK I/O → copy + join + crop\n• NETWORK → streams + uploads\n• FILE RETENTION → ~3 days where applicable\n• RESTREAM WINDOW → ~2 hours\n• PIPELINE CAPACITY → ~200 crops in-flight\n• exact 10-second chunks\n• multiple simultaneous targets\n• limited horizontal + vertical scale\n\nCapacity was part of the architecture.",
      "originalText": "SCALE & CONSTRAINTS\n\n• CPU → FFmpeg processing\n• RAM → concurrent processes / services\n• DISK → raw media + segments + temp files\n• DISK I/O → copy + join + crop\n• NETWORK → streams + uploads\n• FILE RETENTION → ~3 days where applicable\n• RESTREAM WINDOW → ~2 hours\n• PIPELINE CAPACITY → ~200 crops in-flight\n• exact 10-second chunks\n• multiple simultaneous targets\n• limited horizontal + vertical scale\n\nCapacity was part of the architecture.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "scale-constraints",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "boundElements": []
    },
    {
      "id": "text-runtime-inventory",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6642,
      "y": 5156.25,
      "width": 786,
      "height": 297.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a063",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 711694666,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 932412006,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "ON-PREMISES RUNTIME\n\n• Windows / IIS\n• .NET Core Web APIs\n• Console Apps / Workers\n• FFmpeg installed on required machines\n• RabbitMQ\n• Redis\n• one SQL Server instance\n• File Server\n• Logstash + Elasticsearch\n\nNot assumed to share one physical machine.\nNo cloud elasticity.",
      "originalText": "ON-PREMISES RUNTIME\n\n• Windows / IIS\n• .NET Core Web APIs\n• Console Apps / Workers\n• FFmpeg installed on required machines\n• RabbitMQ\n• Redis\n• one SQL Server instance\n• File Server\n• Logstash + Elasticsearch\n\nNot assumed to share one physical machine.\nNo cloud elasticity.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "runtime-inventory",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "boundElements": []
    },
    {
      "id": "text-backpressure",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5690,
      "y": 5906.875,
      "width": 790,
      "height": 106.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a064",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 711710504,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 932621464,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "BACKPRESSURE / CONCURRENCY CONTROL\nArchitectural concern — mechanism not specified\n\nFFmpeg + file copies + join + crop + uploads\ncan saturate CPU • RAM • Disk • I/O • Network",
      "originalText": "BACKPRESSURE / CONCURRENCY CONTROL\nArchitectural concern — mechanism not specified\n\nFFmpeg + file copies + join + crop + uploads\ncan saturate CPU • RAM • Disk • I/O • Network",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "backpressure",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "boundElements": []
    },
    {
      "id": "text-failure-modes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6638,
      "y": 5870,
      "width": 794,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a065",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 711726342,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 932830922,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "FAILURE MODES\nLive ingest • FFmpeg process\nRabbitMQ processing • service unavailable\nfile copy • disk pressure • Join • Crop\npublish API • partial publish\norphan files • message redelivery\n\nKnown capabilities: Retry • DLQ • Reprocessing\nRedis state • destination state • GC • logs",
      "originalText": "FAILURE MODES\nLive ingest • FFmpeg process\nRabbitMQ processing • service unavailable\nfile copy • disk pressure • Join • Crop\npublish API • partial publish\norphan files • message redelivery\n\nKnown capabilities: Retry • DLQ • Reprocessing\nRedis state • destination state • GC • logs",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "failure-modes",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "boundElements": []
    },
    {
      "id": "text-legacy-context",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8014,
      "y": 4833.75,
      "width": 1112,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a066",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 711742180,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 933040380,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "BEFORE\nASP Classic\nLegacy publishing / CRM\nIIS • on-premises\nManual / legacy deployment model",
      "originalText": "BEFORE\nASP Classic\nLegacy publishing / CRM\nIIS • on-premises\nManual / legacy deployment model",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "legacy-context",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "boundElements": []
    },
    {
      "id": "text-modern-context",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8014,
      "y": 5418.75,
      "width": 1112,
      "height": 202.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a067",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 711758018,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 933249838,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "MODERNIZATION\n.NET Core APIs / Services\nSPA\nAzure DevOps\nCI/CD Pipelines\n↓\nDeploy to IIS on-premises\n\nDeployment pipeline is separate from REC media processing.",
      "originalText": "MODERNIZATION\n.NET Core APIs / Services\nSPA\nAzure DevOps\nCI/CD Pipelines\n↓\nDeploy to IIS on-premises\n\nDeployment pipeline is separate from REC media processing.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "modern-context",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "boundElements": []
    },
    {
      "id": "text-engineering-message",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8014,
      "y": 6067.5,
      "width": 1112,
      "height": 85,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a068",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "seed": 711773856,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 933459296,
      "updated": 1790506800000,
      "text": "ENGINEERING WITHIN REAL CONSTRAINTS\nShared filesystem • finite CPU / RAM / disk / I/O • native processes • limited retention • controlled recovery\n\nResilience without pretending the platform was cloud-native.",
      "originalText": "ENGINEERING WITHIN REAL CONSTRAINTS\nShared filesystem • finite CPU / RAM / disk / I/O • native processes • limited retention • controlled recovery\n\nResilience without pretending the platform was cloud-native.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "engineering-message",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "boundElements": []
    },
