      "version": 210,
      "versionNonce": 179365467,
      "updated": 1790548520865,
      "text": "CENTRAL MESSAGE\nThe REC enabled an operator to transform a segment of a live transmission into publishable content for multiple channels.\n\nAn execution did not simply end in success or failure: REC tracked the crop, recovered processing failures, and handled partial publication failure without repeating\ndestinations already completed.",
      "originalText": "CENTRAL MESSAGE\nThe REC enabled an operator to transform a segment of a live transmission into publishable content for multiple channels.\n\nAn execution did not simply end in success or failure: REC tracked the crop, recovered processing failures, and handled partial publication failure without repeating destinations already completed.",
